<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:ns1="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">Miwiti Sinau Wilangan Cacah</title><metadata xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
  <ns1:content-id>m81243</ns1:content-id>
  <ns1:title>Miwiti Sinau Wilangan Cacah</ns1:title>
  <ns1:abstract><para id="para-00001">Sawise sinau bagean iki, kowe bakal bisa:</para>
<list id="list-00001">
<item>Ngenali wilangan asli lan wilangan cacah</item>
<item>Nggambarake wilangan cacah nganggo model</item>
<item>Ngenali nilai panggonane sawijining digit</item>
<item>Nganggo nilai panggonan kanggo nyebut wilangan cacah</item>
<item>Nganggo nilai panggonan kanggo nulis wilangan cacah</item>
<item>Mbunderake wilangan cacah</item>
</list></ns1:abstract>
  <ns1:uuid>7cbc90c7-60c8-4211-bffe-b77aadc95509</ns1:uuid>
</metadata><content>
<section id="fs-id1830385" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Ayo Ngenali Wilangan Asli lan Wilangan Cacah</title><para id="fs-id2325869">Sinau aljabar kuwi kaya sinau basa. Wiwiti saka tembung-tembung dhasar, banjur tambahna sithik-sithik. Kudu kerep latihan supaya tembung-tembung kuwi dadi gampang. Saya kerep dienggo, saya kulina.</para>
<para id="fs-id2269442">Ing aljabar, wilangan lan tandha dienggo nyatakake tembung lan gagasan. Ayo wiwit saka wilangan. Sing paling dhasar yaiku wilangan sing dienggo ngetung barang: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>…</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan sateruse. Wilangan iki jenenge <term id="term-00001">wilangan asli</term>. Tandha “…” jenenge elipsis. Tegese “lan sateruse”: pola kuwi terus, ora ana enteke. Wilangan kanggo ngetung iki uga diarani wilangan natural.</para>
<note id="fs-id2631065">
<title>Wilangan Asli</title>
<para id="fs-id1565524">Wilangan asli wiwit saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan terus sateruse.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1601874" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>5…</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation></note>
<para id="fs-id2741297">Wilangan asli lan wilangan cacah bisa digambar ing <term id="term-00002">garis wilangan</term>, kaya ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_001" />.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_001"><media id="fs-id2316516" alt="Iki gambar garis wilangan saka 0 nganti 6, mundhake siji-siji. Panah ing ndhuwur garis sing nengen diwenehi tulisan “luwih gedhé”. Panah sing ngiwa diwenehi tulisan “luwih cilik”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_001.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>

<caption>Ing garis wilangan, saya nengen wilangane saya gedhé; saya ngiwa wilangane saya cilik.</caption></figure><para id="fs-id1410425">Titik sing tulisane <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> jenenge <term id="term-00003">titik wiwitan</term>. Titik-titik ing tengen <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> jarake padha lan diwenehi label wilangan asli. Yen sawijining wilangan dipasangake karo titik, wilangan kuwi jenenge <term id="term-00004">koordinat</term> titik kuwi.</para>
<para id="fs-id1383646">Panemune wilangan nol kuwi langkah gedhé ing sejarah matematika. Yen nol dilebokake bareng karo wilangan asli, ana kumpulan wilangan anyar sing jenenge <term id="term-00005">wilangan cacah</term>.</para>
<note id="fs-id2606982">
<title>Wilangan Cacah</title>
<para id="fs-id1516323">Wilangan cacah kuwi wilangan asli lan nol.</para>
<equation id="fs-id2260967" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>5…</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation></note>
<para id="fs-id1904853">Anggone nulis iki mandheg ing <m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math> nalika nulis sawetara <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00006">wilangan asli</term> lan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00007">wilangan cacah</term> sing wiwitan. Yen polane durung cetha, wilangan liyane bisa ditulis maneh.</para>
<example id="fs-id1262372">
<exercise id="fs-id1398237"><problem id="fs-id3413579">
<para id="fs-id1393222">Saka wilangan iki, endi sing kalebu <span class="token">ⓐ</span> wilangan asli? <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wilangan cacah?</para><para id="fs-id1269630"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5.2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>105</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2564359">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<list id="fs-id2198081" list-type="labeled-item" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Wilangan asli wiwit saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> mula <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> dudu wilangan asli. Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>105</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kabeh kuwi wilangan asli.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Wilangan cacah kuwi wilangan asli lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>105</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kuwi wilangan cacah.</item></list><para id="fs-id1952631">Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5.2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> dudu wilangan asli lan dudu wilangan cacah. Wilangan iki dirembug mengko.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2698269" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id3298473"><problem id="fs-id2210740">
<para id="fs-id1587799">Saka wilangan iki, endi sing kalebu <span class="token">ⓐ</span> wilangan asli lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wilangan cacah?</para><para id="fs-id1363233"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>11.8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>241</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>376</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2775154">
<list id="fs-id2425678" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 2, 9, 241, 376</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0, 2, 9, 241, 376</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1906330" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1786026"><problem id="fs-id2812320">
<para id="fs-id1409646">Saka wilangan iki, endi sing kalebu <span class="token">ⓐ</span> wilangan asli lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wilangan cacah?</para><para id="fs-id2840506"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>8.8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>201</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1415724">
<list id="fs-id1960220" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 7, 13, 201</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0, 7, 13, 201</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
</section><section id="fs-id2340048" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Ayo Nggawe Model Wilangan Cacah</title><para id="fs-id1862565">Sistem wilangan sing dienggo iki jenenge <term id="term-00008">sistem nilai panggonan</term> amarga nilai saben digit gumantung marang panggonane ing sawijining wilangan. Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>537</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nilaine beda karo wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>735</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Sanajan digite padha, nilaine beda amarga panggonane digit <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> beda.</para><para id="fs-id1461000">Dhuwit bisa dadi conto nilai panggonan sing wis kulina dideleng. Upamane ing dompet ana telung lembar dhuwit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$100</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>, pitung lembar dhuwit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>, lan patang lembar dhuwit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$1</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>. Cacahe bisa dideleng ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_002" />. Dadi, ing dompet kuwi ana dhuwit pira?</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_002"><media id="fs-id1302206" alt="Iki gambar telung tumpukan dhuwit kertas Amerika Serikat. Saka kiwa menyang tengen: telung lembar dhuwit $100, tulisane “Telung lembar dhuwit $100; 3 ping $100 padha karo $300”; pitung lembar dhuwit $10, tulisane “Pitung lembar dhuwit $10; 7 ping $10 padha karo $70”; lan patang lembar dhuwit $1, tulisane “Patang lembar dhuwit $1; 4 ping $1 padha karo $4”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_002.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</figure><para id="fs-id2243766">Etungen dhisik nilai kabeh lembar ing saben jinis dhuwit kertas, banjur tambahna kabeh. Dompet kuwi isine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$374</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<media id="fs-id2438560" alt="Ing gambar ana “$300 + $70 + $4”. Digit 3 ing $300, digit 7 ing $70, lan digit 4 ing $4 wernane abang; sing liyane ireng. Ing ngisore ana $374. Saben digit abang disambungake nganggo panah menyang digit sing cocog ing $374.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_003_img.jpg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id865961">Blok basis-10 bisa dienggo cara liya kanggo nggambarake nilai panggonan, kaya ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_004" />. Blok iki bisa makili atusan, puluhan, lan satuan. Delengen: siji batang puluhan isine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan, dene siji persegi atusan isine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> puluhan, utawa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_004"><media id="fs-id2294051" alt="Ana telung wujud blok basis-10 ing gambar. Sing kapisan, siji blok, tulisane “Siji blok makili 1”. Sing kapindho, batang mendatar sing isine 10 blok, tulisane “Siji batang makili 10”. Sing katelu, persegi sing ukurane 10 ping 10 blok, tulisane “Siji persegi makili 100”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_004.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</figure><para id="fs-id2860981"><link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_005" /> nuduhake wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>138</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> sing digambarake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_005"><media id="fs-id1823977" alt="Ing gambar blok basis-10 ana siji persegi atusan ukuran 10 ping 10 blok, tulisane “1 atusan”; telung batang puluhan, tulisane “3 puluhan”; lan wolung blok satuan, tulisane “8 satuan”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_005.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>

<caption>Notasi nilai panggonan dienggo nuduhake nilai wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>138</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></caption></figure><media id="fs-id2387933" alt="Ing gambar ana “100 + 30 + 8”. Digit 1 ing 100, digit 3 ing 30, lan digit 8 wernane abang; sing liyane ireng. Ing ngisore ana wilangan 138. Saben digit abang disambungake nganggo panah menyang digit sing cocog ing 138.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_006_img.jpg" />
</media>
<table id="fs-id1714120" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel nilai panggonan iki ana 5 kolom lan 5 larik. Larik ndhuwur isine Digit, Nilai panggonan, Wilangan, Nilai, lan Nilai kabeh. Telung larik sabanjure njlentrehake 138: digit 1 ana ing atusan, nilaine 100; digit 3 ana ing puluhan, nilaine 30; digit 8 ana ing satuan, nilaine 8. Larik pungkasan nuduhake yen kabeh ana 138."><label />
<tgroup cols="5"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center">Digit</entry>
<entry align="center">Nilai panggonan</entry>
<entry align="center">Wilangan</entry>
<entry align="center">Nilai</entry>
<entry align="right">Nilai kabeh</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
