</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry /><entry /><entry /><entry /><entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>Kabeh = </m:mtext><m:mn>138</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>






</tgroup>
</table><example id="fs-id2222880">
<exercise id="fs-id2908692"><problem id="fs-id2206322">
<para id="fs-id2939641">Anggonen notasi nilai panggonan kanggo nemtokake nilai wilangan sing digambarake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> sing katon ing gambar.</para>
<media id="fs-id2482064" alt="Ing gambar blok basis-10 ana rong persegi atusan, siji batang puluhan, lan limang blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_007_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1806167">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id1249764">Ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> persegi atusan. Nilai kabeh <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>200</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1348273">Ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> batang puluhan. Nilai kabeh <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id3302675">Ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> blok satuan. Nilai kabeh <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline />
<media id="fs-id2164193" alt="Ing gambar ana “200 + 10 + 5”. Digit 2 ing 200, digit 1 ing 10, lan digit 5 wernane abang; sing liyane ireng. Ing ngisore ana wilangan 215. Saben digit abang disambungake nganggo panah menyang digit sing cocog ing 215.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_008_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
<table id="fs-id1785447" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel nilai panggonan iki ana 5 kolom lan 5 larik. Larik ndhuwur isine Digit, Nilai panggonan, Wilangan, Nilai, lan Nilai kabeh. Telung larik sabanjure njlentrehake 215: digit 2 ana ing atusan, nilaine 200; digit 1 ana ing puluhan, nilaine 10; digit 5 ana ing satuan, nilaine 5. Larik pungkasan nuduhake asile 215."><label />
<tgroup cols="5">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center">Digit</entry>
<entry align="center">Nilai panggonan</entry>
<entry align="center">Wilangan</entry>
<entry align="center">Nilai</entry>
<entry align="right">Nilai kabeh</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center">atusan</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>200</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center">puluhan</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center">satuan</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry /><entry /><entry /><entry /><entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>215</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>






</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1381620">Blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> kuwi nggambarake wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>215</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id835824" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1227376"><problem id="fs-id2652455">
<para id="fs-id2784412">Anggonen notasi nilai panggonan kanggo nemtokake nilai wilangan sing digambarake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> sing katon ing gambar.</para>
<media id="fs-id4224006" alt="Ing gambar blok basis-10 ana siji persegi atusan, pitung batang puluhan, lan nem blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_009_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2609767">
<para id="fs-id2851234">176</para>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id2269666" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1983295"><problem id="fs-id1728004">
<para id="fs-id2111126">Anggonen notasi nilai panggonan kanggo nemtokake nilai wilangan sing digambarake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> sing katon ing gambar.</para>
<media id="fs-id1841537" alt="Ing gambar blok basis-10 ana rong persegi atusan, telung batang puluhan, lan pitung blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_010_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2136425">
<para id="fs-id1829429">237</para>
</solution>
</exercise></note><note id="eip-id1168898089706" class="manipulative-math">Kagiyatan Matematika Manipulatif Garis Wilangan—Bagean 1 bisa mbantu supaya luwih ngerti wilangan asli lan wilangan cacah.</note>
</section><section id="fs-id1883656" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Ayo Ngenali Panggonane Saben Digit</title>
<para id="fs-id1795155">Saka conto dhuwit lan blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>, bisa dideleng yen saben panggonan ing sawijining wilangan nduweni nilai dhewe-dhewe. Katrangan iki bisa diringkes nganggo tabel nilai panggonan. Panggonan-panggonan mau diklompokake telu-telu; saben klompok diarani periode. <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00009">Periode</term> mau yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">satuan, éwuan, yutanan, milyaran, trilyunan</emphasis>, lan sateruse. Yen wilangane ditulis, saben periode dipisah nganggo tandha koma.</para><para id="fs-id2825467">Kaya sing dideleng ing blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>, siji batang puluhan nilaine sepuluh ping nilaine siji blok satuan, lan siji persegi atusan nilaine sepuluh ping nilaine siji batang puluhan. Semono uga ing tabel: saben panggonan nilaine sepuluh ping nilaine panggonan ing sisih tengene.</para>
<para id="fs-id1408851"><link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_011" /> nuduhake carane wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5,278,194</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis ing tabel nilai panggonan.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_011"><media id="fs-id1339846" alt="Bagan iki irah-irahane 'Nilai Panggonan'. Ana limalas kolom lan 4 larik. Kolome diklompokake dadi lima, saben klompok isi telung kolom. Larik ndhuwur nuduhake Trilyun, Milyar, Yuta, Éwuan, lan Satuan. Larik sabanjure isine 'Atusan trilyun', 'Sepuluh trilyun', 'trilyun', 'Atusan milyar', 'Sepuluh milyar', 'milyar', 'Satus yuta', 'Sepuluh yuta', 'yutanan', 'Satus éwu', 'Sepuluh éwu', 'éwuan', 'atusan', 'puluhan', lan 'satuan'. 8 panggonan kapisan ing larik sabanjure kosong. Wiwit kolom kaping sanga, isine '5', '2', '7', '8', '1', '9', lan '4'.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_011.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</figure><list id="fs-id930962" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing yutanan. Nilaine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5,000,000</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing atusan éwu. Nilaine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>200,000</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing puluhan éwu. Nilaine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70,000</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing éwuan. Nilaine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8,000</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing atusan. Nilaine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing puluhan. Nilaine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>90</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing satuan. Nilaine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
</list>
<example id="fs-id1891091">
<exercise id="fs-id1256900"><problem id="fs-id1581177">
<para id="fs-id1738612">Ing wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>63,407,218</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> temtokna panggonane saben digit iki:</para>
<list id="fs-id2218367" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></item><item> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math></item><item> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> </item><item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math> </item><item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2851093">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id2281077">Tulisen wilangan kuwi ing tabel nilai panggonan, diwiwiti saka sisih tengen.<newline />
<media id="fs-id2297687" alt="Gambar iki irah-irahane “Nilai Panggonan”, isine limalas kolom lan 2 larik. Kolome diklompokake dadi lima, saben klompok isi telung kolom. Larik kapisan isine “Atusan trilyun”, “Sepuluh trilyun”, “trilyun”, “Atusan milyar”, “Sepuluh milyar”, “milyar”, “Satus yuta”, “Sepuluh yuta”, “yutanan”, “Satus éwu”, “Sepuluh éwu”, “éwuan”, “atusan”, “puluhan”, lan “satuan”. 7 panggonan kapisan ing larik kapindho kosong. Wiwit kolom kaping wolu, isine “6”, “3”, “4”, “0”, “7”, “2”, “1” lan “8”. Klompok kapisan diwenehi tulisan “trilyun” lan ngemot “Atusan trilyun”, “Sepuluh trilyun”, lan “trilyun”. Klompok kapindho diwenehi tulisan “milyar” lan ngemot “Atusan milyar”, “Sepuluh milyar”, lan “milyar”. Klompok katelu diwenehi tulisan “yutanan” lan ngemot “Atusan yuta”, “Sepuluh yuta”, lan “yutanan”. Klompok kapapat diwenehi tulisan “éwuan” lan ngemot “Atusan éwu”, “Sepuluh éwu”, lan “éwuan”. Klompok kalima diwenehi tulisan “satuan” lan ngemot “Atusan”, “puluhan”, lan “satuan”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_012_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para>
<list id="eip-id1168898159450" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Digit <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> ana ing éwuan.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Digit <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> ana ing puluhan éwu.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing puluhan.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing puluhan yuta.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing yutanan.</item>
</list></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2310429" class="try"><exercise id="fs-id1573052"><problem id="fs-id1607674">
<para id="fs-id1816164">Kanggo saben wilangan iki, temtokna panggonane saben digit sing disebut: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>27,493,615</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<list id="fs-id1386307" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> <m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math></item>
</list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2903653">
<list id="fs-id1811287" class="circled" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> puluhan yuta</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> puluhan</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> atusan éwu</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> yutanan</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> satuan</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note><note id="fs-id1282619" class="try"><exercise id="fs-id1518735"><problem id="fs-id3013699">
<para id="fs-id1778628">Kanggo saben wilangan iki, temtokna panggonane saben digit sing disebut: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>519,711,641,328</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<list id="fs-id1508784" class="circled" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></item>
</list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2619544">
<list id="fs-id1807276" list-type="labeled-item" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> milyaran</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> puluhan éwu</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> puluhan</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> atusan éwu</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> atusan yuta</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note></section><section id="fs-id1321580" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Ayo Nyebut Wilangan Cacah nganggo Nilai Panggonan</title><para id="fs-id2566318">Yen nulis cek, wilangane ditulis nganggo tembung lan uga digit. Carane, tulisen wilangan ing saben periode, banjur jeneng periodene. Wiwiti saka digit paling kiwa, sing nilai panggonane paling gedhé. Koma kuwi misahake periode. Mula, yen ing wilangane ana koma, ing tulisan tembunge uga diwenehi koma. Jeneng periode satuan ora perlu disebut. Periode iki nilai panggonane paling cilik.</para>
<figure id="eip-id1168289680652" class="unnumbered"><label /><media id="fs-id1227744" alt="Ana telung nilai ing gambar iki, dipisah nganggo koma. Sing kapisan “37”, tulisane “yutanan”. Sing kapindho “519”, tulisane “éwuan”. Sing katelu “248”, tulisane “satuan”. Ing ngisore, ana panah saka “37” menyang “Telung puluh pitu yuta”, saka “519” menyang “Limang atus sangalas éwu”, lan saka “248” menyang “Rong atus patang puluh wolu”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_013_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></figure><para id="fs-id2220075">Dadi, wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>37,519,248</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yen ditulis nganggo tembung dadi telung puluh pitu yuta, limang atus sangalas éwu, rong atus patang puluh wolu.</para>
<para id="fs-id3400199">Gatekna, tembung <emphasis effect="italics">lan</emphasis> ora dienggo nalika nyebut wilangan cacah.</para>
<note id="fs-id1364640" class="howto"><title>Ayo nyebut wilangan cacah nganggo tembung.</title><list id="eip-375" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Wiwiti saka digit paling kiwa. Sebutna wilangan ing saben periode, banjur jeneng periodene. Yen wis tekan periode satuan, jeneng periodene ora usah disebut.</item>
<item>Pisahna saben periode nganggo koma kaya ing wilangane.</item></list></note><example id="fs-id2326974"><exercise id="fs-id1545709"><problem id="fs-id882630">
<para id="fs-id1880734">Sebutna wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8,165,432,098,710</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nganggo tembung.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2196744">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="fs-id1171100715908" aria-label="Wiwiti saka digit paling kiwa, yaiku 8. Digit kuwi ana ing trilyunan: wolung trilyun. / Sabanjure ing sisih tengen ana periode milyaran: satus sewidak lima milyar. / Sabanjure periode yutanan: patang atus telung puluh loro yuta. / Sabanjure periode éwuan: sangang puluh wolu éwu. / Sing paling tengen periode satuan: pitung atus sepuluh." class="unnumbered unstyled">
<tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Wiwiti saka digit paling kiwa, yaiku 8. Digit kuwi ana ing trilyunan.</entry>
    <entry>wolung trilyun</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Sabanjure ing sisih tengen ana periode milyaran.</entry>
    <entry>satus sewidak lima milyar</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Sabanjure ing sisih tengen ana periode yutanan.</entry>
    <entry>patang atus telung puluh loro yuta</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Sabanjure ing sisih tengen ana periode éwuan.</entry>
    <entry>sangang puluh wolu éwu</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Sing paling tengen kuwi periode satuan.</entry>
    <entry>pitung atus sepuluh</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="eip-id1168287499693"><media id="fs-id1209906" alt="Ana limang nilai ing gambar iki, dipisah nganggo koma. Sing kapisan “8”, tulisane “trilyun”. Sing kapindho “165”, tulisane “milyar”. Sing katelu “432”, tulisane “yutanan”. Sing kapapat “098”, tulisane “éwuan”. Sing kalima “710”, tulisane “satuan”. Ing ngisore, saka “8” ana panah menyang “Wolung trilyun”, saka “165” ana panah menyang “Satus sewidak lima milyar”, saka “432” ana panah menyang “Patang atus telung puluh loro yuta”, saka “098” ana panah menyang “Sangang puluh wolu éwu”, lan saka “710” ana panah menyang “pitung atus sepuluh”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_014_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para>
<para id="fs-id1851678">Yen kabeh tembunge dirangkai, wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8,165,432,098,710</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis dadi wolung trilyun, satus sewidak lima milyar, patang atus telung puluh loro yuta, sangang puluh wolu éwu, pitung atus sepuluh.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id2774887" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2601285">
<problem id="fs-id2353164">
<para id="fs-id2269538">Sebutna wilangan iki nganggo tembung: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9,258,137,904,061</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1312880">
<para id="fs-id1469854">sangang trilyun, rong atus sèket wolu milyar, satus telung puluh pitu yuta, sangang atus papat éwu, sewidak siji</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2136533" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1773572">
<problem id="fs-id2926171">
<para id="fs-id2555667">Sebutna wilangan iki nganggo tembung: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17,864,325,619,004</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1683677">
<para id="fs-id1278691">pitulas trilyun, wolung atus sewidak papat milyar, telung atus salawé yuta, nem atus sangalas éwu, papat</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1825910">
<exercise id="fs-id1314136">
<problem id="fs-id4315464">
<para id="fs-id2627959">Ana siswa sing neliti lan nemokake yen cacahe pangguna ponsel ing Amerika Serikat sajrone salah siji sasi ing taun <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2014</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mstyle fontweight="bold"><m:mn>327,577,529</m:mn></m:mstyle><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Sebutna wilangan kuwi nganggo tembung.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2425040">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id1526255">Delengen periode-periode ing wilangan kuwi.<newline />
<media id="fs-id2670483" alt="Ana telung nilai ing gambar iki, dipisah nganggo koma. Sing kapisan “327”, tulisane “yutanan”. Sing kapindho “577”, tulisane “éwuan”. Sing katelu “529”, tulisane “satuan”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_015_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para><para id="fs-id2263806">Sebutna wilangan ing saben periode, banjur jeneng periodene. Saben periode dipisah nganggo koma.</para>
<para id="fs-id1738516">Periode yutanan: telung atus pitulikur yuta</para>
<para id="fs-id1409152">Periode éwuan: limang atus pitung puluh pitu éwu</para>
<para id="fs-id1344528">Periode satuan: limang atus sangalikur</para><para id="fs-id1394436">Dadi, cacahe pangguna ponsel ing Amerika Serikat ing sasi April yaiku telung atus pitulikur yuta, limang atus pitung puluh pitu éwu, limang atus sangalikur.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1628781" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2472209">
<problem id="fs-id2223828">
<para id="fs-id1919954">Cacahe wong sing manggon ing sawijining negara yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>316,128,839</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Sebutna wilangan kuwi.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1393924">
<para id="fs-id2243722">telung atus nembelas yuta, satus wolulikur éwu, wolung atus telung puluh sanga</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1808812" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2060477">
<problem id="fs-id2172100">
<para id="fs-id1250766">Sataun kuwi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>31,536,000</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> detik. Sebutna wilangan kuwi.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1360632">
<para id="fs-id1269733">telung puluh siji yuta, limang atus telung puluh enem éwu</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section><section id="fs-id1339359" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Ayo Nulis Wilangan Cacah nganggo Nilai Panggonan</title>
<para id="fs-id2607182">Saiki ayo mbalikke carane. Wilangan sing wis ditulis nganggo tembung bakal kita tulis nganggo digit.</para>
<note id="fs-id2398163" class="howto"><title>Ayo nulis wilangan cacah nganggo nilai panggonan.</title><list id="eip-100" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Goleki tembung-tembung sing nuduhake periodene. (Elinga, jeneng periode satuan kuwi ora tau disebut.)</item>
<item>Gawe telung panggonan kosong kanggo nuduhake pira panggonan sing dibutuhake saben periode. Saben periode dipisah nganggo koma.</item>
<item>Sebutna wilangan ing saben periode, banjur pasang digite ing panggonan sing bener miturut nilai panggonane.</item></list>


</note><example id="fs-id2376697"><exercise id="fs-id1340436"><problem id="fs-id845531">
<para id="fs-id1576302">Wilangan-wilangan iki tulisen nganggo digit.</para>
<list id="fs-id2264653" list-type="labeled-item" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> sèket telu yuta, patang atus siji éwu, pitung atus patang puluh loro</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> sangang milyar, rong atus patang puluh enem yuta, pitung puluh telu éwu, satus wolung puluh sanga</item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1786412">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id3402446"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Goleki tembung-tembung sing nuduhake periodene.</para><para id="fs-id2198541">Saliyane periode kapisan, saben periode kudu nduweni telung panggonan. Gambar telung panggonan kosong kanggo nuduhake pira panggonan sing dibutuhake saben periode. Saben periode dipisah nganggo koma.</para>
<para id="fs-id4300938">Banjur tulisen digite ing saben periode.<newline />
<media id="fs-id2668978" alt="Ana telung blok teks ing gambar iki sing nuding menyang nilai angka. Blok kapisan tulisane “sèket telu yuta”, labele “yutanan”, lan nuding menyang 53. Blok kapindho tulisane “patang atus siji éwu”, labele “éwuan”, lan nuding menyang 401. Blok katelu tulisane “pitung atus patang puluh loro”, labele “satuan”, lan nuding menyang 742.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_016_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para><para id="fs-id1726897">Gabungna kabeh digite lan komane. Wilangane dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>53,401,742</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1683995"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Goleki tembung-tembung sing nuduhake periodene.</para><para id="fs-id2159900">Saliyane periode kapisan, saben periode kudu nduweni telung panggonan. Gambar telung panggonan kosong kanggo nuduhake pira panggonan sing dibutuhake saben periode. Saben periode dipisah nganggo koma.</para>
<para id="fs-id3429801">Banjur tulisen digite ing saben periode.<newline />
<media id="fs-id2903601" alt="Ana patang blok teks ing gambar iki sing nuding menyang nilai angka. Blok kapisan tulisane “sangang milyar”, labele “milyar”, lan nuding menyang 9. Blok kapindho tulisane “rong atus patang puluh enem yuta”, labele “yutanan”, lan nuding menyang 246. Blok katelu tulisane “pitung puluh telu éwu”, labele “éwuan”, lan nuding menyang 073. Blok kapapat tulisane “satus wolung puluh sanga”, labele “satuan”, lan nuding menyang 189.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_017_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para><para id="fs-id1374355">Wilangan kuwi yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9,246,073,189</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id2880619">Gatekna, ing bagean <span class="token">ⓑ</span>, nol dibutuhake kanggo ngisi panggonan atusan éwu. Aja lali nulis nol yen perlu supaya saben periode nduweni telung panggonan. Sing bisa dadi pangecualian mung periode kapisan.</para></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1542693" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2646708">
<problem id="fs-id3436547">
<para id="fs-id2270159">Saben wilangan iki tulisen nganggo digit ing wujud standar:</para>
<para id="fs-id2149876">sèket telu yuta, wolung atus sanga éwu, sèket siji.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id998472">
<para id="fs-id4163187">53,809,051</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2437124" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2202956">
<problem id="fs-id1402052">
<para id="fs-id1337332">Saben wilangan iki tulisen nganggo digit ing wujud standar:</para>
<para id="fs-id1792489">rong milyar, rolikur yuta, pitung atus patbelas éwu, patang atus sewidak enem.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1330293">
<para id="fs-id1885399">2,022,714,466</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id3202693">
<exercise id="fs-id1336757">
<problem id="fs-id1917299">
<para id="fs-id2590590">Anggarane salah siji negara bagean watara <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$77</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> milyar. Anggaran kuwi tulisen nganggo digit ing wujud standar.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1949045">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id2634266">Delengen periodene. Ing kene mung ana rong digit sing diwenehake, lan loro-lorone ana ing periode milyaran. Supaya wilangane bisa ditulis kanthi lengkap, isi kabeh periode liyane nganggo digit nol.<newline />
<media id="fs-id1345376" alt="Ana patang blok teks ing gambar iki sing nuding menyang nilai angka. Blok kapisan isine “77 milyar”, labele “milyaran”, lan nuding menyang “77”. Blok kapindho kosong, labele “yutanan”, lan nuding menyang “000”. Blok katelu kosong, labele “éwuan”, lan nuding menyang “000”. Blok kapapat kosong, labele “satuan”, lan nuding menyang “000”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_018_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para><para id="fs-id2319817">Dadi, anggarane watara <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$77,000,000,000.</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1805534" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1485641">
<problem id="fs-id1929413">
<para id="fs-id2262938">Saben wilangan iki tulisen nganggo digit ing wujud standar:</para>
<para id="fs-id1800228">Jarak paling cedhak saka Bumi menyang Mars kuwi watara <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>34</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yuta mil.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1779102">
<para id="fs-id865214">34,000,000 mil</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1397780" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2133886">
<problem id="fs-id1781552">
<para id="fs-id1515747">Saben wilangan iki tulisen nganggo digit ing wujud standar:</para>
<para id="fs-id1586764">Kapal induk kuwi bobot totale <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>204</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yuta pound.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2262414">
<para id="fs-id1395137">204,000,000 pound</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section><section id="fs-id2472737" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Ayo Mbunderake Wilangan Cacah</title><para id="fs-id1333125">Ing taun <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2013</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Biro Sensus Amerika Serikat nglaporake yen cacahe wong ing negara bagean New York yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19,651,127</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> wong. Bisa uga cukup yen kita ngomong cacahe watara <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yuta wong. Tembung <emphasis effect="italics">watara</emphasis> tegese <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yuta kuwi dudu cacah sing pas, nanging wis cedhak karo cacah sing pas.</para>
<para id="fs-id2368933">Nggoleki nilai sing cedhak karo sawijining wilangan kuwi diarani <term id="term-00010">pambunderan</term>. Wilangan dibunderake menyang nilai panggonan tartamtu, gumantung sepira tlitine nilai sing dibutuhake. Nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yuta kuwi asil pambunderan menyang panggonan yutanan. Yen dibunderake menyang atusan éwu, asile <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19,700,000</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>. Yen dibunderake menyang puluhan éwu, asile <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19,650,000</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>, lan sateruse. Arep dibunderake menyang nilai panggonan endi kuwi gumantung wilangane arep dienggo apa.</para><para id="fs-id2132131">Garis wilangan bisa mbantu kita mbayangake lan ngerti carane mbunderake. Delengen garis wilangan ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_019" />. Upamane kita arep mbunderake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak. Ing garis wilangan, apa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> luwih cedhak karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> utawa karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>?</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_019"><media id="fs-id3447999" alt="Ana garis wilangan saka 70 nganti 80, mundhak siji saben langkah. Wilangan 70 lan 80 wernane abang. Ana titik ing “76” ing garis wilangan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_019.jpg" />
</media>

<caption>Katon yen <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> luwih cedhak karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> tinimbang karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Dadi, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yen dibunderake menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></caption></figure><para id="fs-id1885331">Saiki delengen wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Goleki <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_020" />.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_020"><media id="fs-id2907091" alt="Ana garis wilangan saka 70 nganti 80, mundhak siji saben langkah. Wilangan 70 lan 80 wernane abang. Ana titik ing “72” ing garis wilangan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_020.jpg" />
</media>

<caption>Katon yen <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> luwih cedhak karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> mula <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yen dibunderake menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></caption></figure><para id="fs-id2646813">Kepiye carane mbunderake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>75</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak? Goleki <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>75</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_021" />.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_021"><media id="fs-id2471614" alt="Ana garis wilangan saka 70 nganti 80, mundhak siji saben langkah. Wilangan 70 lan 80 wernane abang. Ana titik ing “75” ing garis wilangan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_021.jpg" />
</media>

<caption>Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>75</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana pas ing tengah antarane <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></caption></figure><para id="fs-id1384953">Supaya kabeh wong carane mbunderake padha ing kahanan kaya iki, para ahli matematika sarujuk milih wilangan sing luwih gedhé, yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Dadi, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>75</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yen dibunderake menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1545266">Sawise ndeleng carane ing garis wilangan, saiki kita bisa sinau cara sing luwih umum. Yen arep mbunderake wilangan menyang nilai panggonan tartamtu, delengen digit sing pas ing sisih tengene. Yen digit kuwi luwih cilik tinimbang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> bunderna mudhun. Yen digit kuwi luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> bunderna munggah.</para>
<para id="fs-id1583269">Contone, yen arep mbunderake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak, kita ndeleng digit ing panggonan satuan.</para>
<media id="fs-id1318626" alt="Ana wilangan 76. Label biru “panggonan puluhan” nuding digit 7, lan label abang “luwih gedhé tinimbang 5” nuding digit 6.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_022.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id1717390">Digit ing panggonan satuan kuwi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Amarga <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math> luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> digit ing panggonan puluhan ditambahi siji. Dadi, <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan puluhan dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Banjur, ganti kabeh digit ing sisih tengene <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math> nganggo nol. Dadi, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> dibunderake dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<media id="fs-id1233161" alt="Gambar iki nuduhake carane mbunderake 76 dadi 80. Digit 6 dicoret lan ana pituduh “ganti nganggo 0”. Digit 7 diwenehi pituduh “tambahna 1”. Asile 80 ditulis ing ngisore.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_031_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id2966405">Ayo dideleng maneh <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00011">pambunderan</term> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> menyang wilangan sing paling cedhak lan dadi kelipatan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Maneh, kita ndeleng panggonan satuan.</para>
<media id="fs-id2306384" alt="Ana wilangan 72. Label biru “panggonan puluhan” nuding digit 7, lan label abang “luwih cilik tinimbang 5” nuding digit 2.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_032_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id2700449">Digit ing panggonan satuan kuwi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Amarga <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> luwih cilik tinimbang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> digit ing panggonan puluhan tetep, lan digit ing sisih tengene diganti nganggo nol. Dadi, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yen dibunderake menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<media id="fs-id2588331" alt="Gambar iki nuduhake carane mbunderake 72 dadi 70. Digit 2 dicoret lan ana pituduh “ganti nganggo 0”. Digit 7 diwenehi pituduh “aja ditambahi 1”. Asile 70 ditulis ing ngisore.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_033_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
<note id="fs-id1627986" class="howto"><title>Ayo mbunderake wilangan cacah menyang nilai panggonan tartamtu.</title><list id="eip-id1168287215567" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Goleki nilai panggonan sing wis ditemtokake. Kabeh digit ing sisih kiwane tetep, kajaba yen digit ing nilai panggonan kuwi 9; yen mangkono, digit ing sisih kiwa bisa owah. (Delengen Langkah 3.)</item>
<item>Wenehi garis ing ngisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen nilai panggonan kuwi.</item>
<item>Delengen apa digit iki luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>
<list id="fs-id2486248" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Ya—tambahna <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing digit ing nilai panggonan kuwi. Yen digite 9, ganti nganggo 0 lan tambahna 1 ing digit sing pas ing sisih kiwane. Yen digit kuwi uga 9, baleni langkah iki.</item>
<item>Ora—digit ing nilai panggonan kuwi aja diowahi.</item>
</list></item>
<item>Kabeh digit ing sisih tengen nilai panggonan kuwi diganti nganggo nol.</item></list></note><example id="fs-id1395272"><exercise id="fs-id3298586"><problem id="fs-id3365604">
<para id="fs-id555970">Bunderna <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>843</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1245694">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-659" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Tabel iki ana rong kolom. Kolom kapisan ngandhani pamaca supaya nggoleki panggonan puluhan. Ing jejere ana wilangan 843 kanthi label “panggonan puluhan” sing nuding digit 4. Larik sabanjure ngandhani supaya digit ing sisih tengen panggonan puluhan diwenehi garis ing ngisore, banjur ana wilangan 843 sing digit 3 diwenehi garis ing ngisore. Larik sabanjure nerangake: amarga 3 luwih cilik tinimbang 5, digit ing panggonan puluhan tetep. Ing jejere ana wilangan 843 sing digit 3 isih ana garis ing ngisore. Larik sabanjure ngandhani supaya kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan puluhan diganti nganggo nol. Ing jejere ana wilangan 840 sing digit 0 diwenehi garis ing ngisore. Larik pungkasan nerangake yen 843 dibunderake menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak dadi 840."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry valign="bottom">Goleki panggonan puluhan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287213054" alt="Wilangan 843, kanthi label “panggonan puluhan” sing nuding digit 4.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_034_img-01.png.id-ID.svg" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Wenehi garis ing ngisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen panggonan puluhan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288706202" alt="Wilangan 843 sing digit 3 diwenehi garis ing ngisore.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_034_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Amarga 3 luwih cilik tinimbang 5, digit ing panggonan puluhan aja diowahi.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288469372" alt="Wilangan 843 sing digit 3 diwenehi garis ing ngisore.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_034_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan puluhan diganti nganggo nol.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288213158" alt="Wilangan 840 sing digit 0 diwenehi garis ing ngisore.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_034_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
     <entry />
     <entry>Yen 843 dibunderake menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak, asile 840.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>







</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id2324035" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1312230">
<problem id="fs-id1361993">
<para id="fs-id1347444">Bunderna menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>157</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2458753">
<para id="fs-id1178888">160</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2306340" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2648829">
<problem id="fs-id1732081">
<para id="fs-id2210570">Bunderna menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>884</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1822077">
<para id="fs-id1269556">880</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id3407439"><exercise id="fs-id1788778"><problem id="fs-id2351315">
<para id="fs-id1339512">Saben wilangan iki bunderna menyang atusan sing paling cedhak:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168287209769" class="circled" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>23,658</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>3,978</m:mn></m:math></item></list>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1352043">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>

 <table id="eip-493" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Cara ngrampungake bagean a. Tabel iki ana rong kolom: sing kiwa isine pituduh, sing tengen nuduhake wilangan. Larik kapisan ngandhani pamaca supaya nggoleki panggonan atusan. Ing jejere ana wilangan 23,658 kanthi label “panggonan atusan” sing nuding digit 6. Larik sabanjure nerangake yen digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan kuwi 5 lan kudu diwenehi garis ing ngisore. Ing jejere ana wilangan 23,658 sing digit 5 diwenehi garis ing ngisore. Larik sabanjure nerangake: amarga 5 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, bunderna munggah kanthi nambahake 1 ing digit panggonan atusan, banjur kabeh digit ing sisih tengene diganti nganggo nol. Ing jejere ana wilangan 23,658 kanthi label “tambahna 1” sing nuding digit 6 lan label “ganti nganggo nol” sing nuding digit 5 lan 8. Panahe tumuju asil 23,700. Larik pungkasan nerangake yen 23,658 dibunderake menyang atusan sing paling cedhak dadi 23,700."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
<row><entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> </entry><entry /></row>
  <row>
    <entry valign="bottom">Goleki panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288300776" alt="Ana panah saka 'panggonan atusan' menyang digit 6 ing wilangan 23,658. Iki nuduhake konsep nilai panggonan."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_035_img-01.png.id-ID.svg" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan kuwi 5. Wenehi garis ing ngisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288227113" alt="Wilangan 23,658 ditulis nganggo garis mendatar ing ngisore digit 5."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_035_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Amarga 5 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, bunderna munggah: tambahna 1 ing digit panggonan atusan. Banjur kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan diganti nganggo nol.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287065587" alt="Ana wilangan 23,658 kanthi panah sing nuding digit 6 lan pituduh supaya ditambahi 1. Ana uga panah sing nuding digit 5 lan 8, kanthi pituduh supaya diganti nganggo nol. Asile 23,700."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_035_img-02.png.id-ID.svg" /></media><newline />Dadi, yen 23,658 dibunderake menyang atusan sing paling cedhak, asile 23,700.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>





</tgroup>
</table><table id="eip-379" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Cara ngrampungake bagean b. Tabel iki ana rong kolom: sing kiwa isine pituduh, sing tengen nuduhake wilangan. Larik kapisan ngandhani pamaca supaya nggoleki panggonan atusan. Ing jejere ana wilangan 3,978 kanthi label “panggonan atusan” sing nuding digit 9. Larik sabanjure ngandhani supaya digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan diwenehi garis ing ngisore. Ing jejere ana wilangan 3,978 sing digit 7 diwenehi garis ing ngisore. Larik sabanjure nerangake yen digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan kuwi 7. Amarga 7 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, tambahna 1 ing digit 9, tulisen 0 ing panggonan atusan, tambahna 1 ing panggonan éwuan, banjur ganti digit 7 lan 8 nganggo nol. Panahe tumuju asil 4,000. Larik pungkasan nerangake yen 3,978 dibunderake menyang atusan sing paling cedhak dadi 4,000."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row><entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> </entry><entry /></row><row>
    <entry valign="bottom">Goleki panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289428642" alt="Ana panah menyang '9' ing wilangan 3,978 lan tulisan 'panggonan atusan' ing ndhuwure. Iki nuduhake digit atusan ing wilangan sing ana patang digite."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_036_img-01.png.id-ID.svg" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Wenehi garis ing ngisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168286086719" alt="Wilangan 3,978 ditulis nganggo garis mendatar ing ngisore digit 7."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_036_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan kuwi 7. Amarga 7 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, bunderna munggah kanthi nambahake 1 ing 9. Banjur kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan diganti nganggo nol.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289428689" alt="Gambar iki nuduhake carane mbunderake 3,978 menyang atusan sing paling cedhak. Digit atusan 9 ditambahi 1 dadi 10. Digit 0 ditulis ing panggonan atusan, 1 ditambahake ing digit 3 ing panggonan éwuan, lan digit liyane diganti nganggo nol. Asile 4,000."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_036_img-02.png.id-ID.svg" /></media><newline />Dadi, yen 3,978 dibunderake menyang atusan sing paling cedhak, asile 4,000.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1518702" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1288049">
<problem id="fs-id1512227">
<para id="fs-id2133764">Bunderna menyang atusan sing paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17,852</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2877246">
<para id="fs-id1336744">17,900</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2149604" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1153191">
<problem id="fs-id1792323">
<para id="fs-id1939348">Bunderna menyang atusan sing paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4,951</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1461584">
<para id="fs-id1344986">5,000</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1263758"><exercise id="fs-id1951300"><problem id="fs-id1471031">
<para id="fs-id2283895">Saben wilangan iki bunderna menyang éwuan sing paling cedhak:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168289456047" class="circled" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>147,032</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>29,504</m:mn></m:math></item>
</list>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1559025">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title><table id="eip-695" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Tabel iki ana rong kolom: sing kiwa isine pituduh, sing tengen nuduhake wilangan. Larik kapisan nuduhake wilangan 147,032 kanthi label “panggonan éwuan” sing nuding digit 7, lan pituduh supaya digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan diwenehi garis ing ngisore. Larik sabanjure nerangake yen digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan kuwi 0. Amarga 0 luwih cilik tinimbang 5, digit ing panggonan éwuan tetep. Ing jejere ana wilangan 147,032 sing digit 0 diwenehi garis ing ngisore. Larik sabanjure ngandhani supaya kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan diganti nganggo nol. Ing jejere ana wilangan 147,000. Larik pungkasan nerangake yen 147,032 dibunderake menyang éwuan sing paling cedhak dadi 147,000."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row><entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> </entry><entry /></row><row>
    <entry valign="bottom">Goleki panggonan éwuan. Wenehi garis ing ngisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168285947958" alt="Ana wilangan 147,032 kanthi panah sing nuding digit 7 lan label sing nerangake yen digit kuwi ana ing panggonan éwuan."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_037_img-01.png.id-ID.svg" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan kuwi 0. Amarga 0 luwih cilik tinimbang 5, digit ing panggonan éwuan tetep.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168285947976" alt="Ana wilangan 147,032 sing digit 0 ing panggonan atusan diwenehi garis ing ngisore."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_037_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Banjur, kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan diganti nganggo nol.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168286217819" alt="Wilangan 147,000 ditampilake minangka asil pambunderane."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_037_img-03.png" /></media><newline />Dadi, yen 147,032 dibunderake menyang éwuan sing paling cedhak, asile 147,000.</entry>
  </row>

</tbody>






</tgroup>
</table><table id="eip-596" class="unnumbered unstyled has-images" aria-label="Tabel iki ana rong kolom: sing kiwa isine pituduh, sing tengen nuduhake wilangan. Larik kapisan ngandhani pamaca supaya nggoleki panggonan éwuan. Ing jejere ana wilangan 29,504 kanthi label “panggonan éwuan” sing nuding digit 9. Larik sabanjure ngandhani supaya digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan diwenehi garis ing ngisore. Ing jejere ana wilangan 29,504 sing digit 5 diwenehi garis ing ngisore. Larik sabanjure nerangake yen digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan kuwi 5. Amarga 5 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, tambahna 1 ing digit 9, tulisen 0 ing panggonan éwuan, tambahna 1 ing panggonan puluhan éwu, banjur ganti telung digit pungkasan nganggo nol. Panahe tumuju asil 30,000. Larik pungkasan nerangake yen 29,504 dibunderake menyang éwuan sing paling cedhak dadi 30,000."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row><entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> </entry><entry /></row><row>
    <entry valign="bottom">Goleki panggonan éwuan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287387756" alt="Ana wilangan 29,504 kanthi panah sing nuding digit 9 lan label sing nerangake yen digit kuwi ana ing panggonan éwuan."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_038_img-01.png.id-ID.svg" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Wenehi garis ing ngisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168284799982" alt="Ana wilangan 29,504 sing digit 5 diwenehi garis ing ngisore."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_038_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan kuwi 5. Amarga 5 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, bunderna munggah kanthi nambahake 1 ing 9. Banjur kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan diganti nganggo nol.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288313851" alt="Gambar iki nuduhake carane mbunderake 29,504 menyang éwuan sing paling cedhak. Siji ditambahake ing digit 9 ing panggonan éwuan dadi 10. Ing panggonan éwuan ditulis 0, banjur 1 ditambahake ing panggonan puluhan éwu, lan telung digit pungkasan diganti nganggo nol. Asile 30,000."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_038_img-03.png.id-ID.svg" /></media><newline />Dadi, yen 29,504 dibunderake menyang éwuan sing paling cedhak, asile 30,000.</entry></row>

</tbody>








</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1751923">Gatekna, ing bagean <span class="token">ⓑ</span>, nalika kita nambahake <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> éwu ing <m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math> éwu, gunggunge dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> éwu. Iki bisa diklompokake maneh dadi <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> klompok sepuluh éwu lan <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> éwu. Kita nambahake <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> klompok sepuluh éwu kuwi ing <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> klompok sepuluh éwu, banjur nulis <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan éwuan.</para></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id2603401" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id3447872">
<problem id="fs-id2168214">
<para id="fs-id1756663">Bunderna menyang éwuan sing paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>63,921</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2947129">
<para id="fs-id1823220">64,000</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id4211785" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1371038">
<problem id="fs-id2279344">
<para id="fs-id2276491">Bunderna menyang éwuan sing paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>156,437</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1251048">
<para id="fs-id2174049">156,000</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id3323694" class="media-2"><title>BUKAK SUMBER PASINAON TAMBAHAN ING INTERNET</title><list id="fs-id1881276" display="block">
<item><link url="https://www.openstax.org/l/24detplaceval">Goleki Nilai Panggonane</link></item>
<item><link url="https://www.openstax.org/l/24numdigword">Saka Tembung, Tulisen Wilangan Cacah nganggo Digit</link></item>
</list>
</note></section><section id="fs-id2296006" class="key-concepts" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Bab-bab Sing Pokok</title><figure id="eip-id1170196618448"><media id="eip-id1170196618449" alt="Bagan kanthi judhul 'Nilai Panggonan' nduweni limalas kolom lan 4 baris. Kolome dipérang dadi limang klompok, saben klompok ana telung kolom. Baris judhul nuduhake Trilyun, Milyar, Yuta, Éwuan, lan Satuan. Baris sabanjure isine 'Atusan trilyun', 'Sepuluh trilyun', 'trilyun', 'satus milyar', 'sepuluh milyar', 'milyar', 'satus yuta', 'sepuluh yuta', 'yutanan', 'satus éwu', 'sepuluh éwu', 'éwuan', 'atusan', 'puluhan', lan 'satuan'. Ing baris sabanjure, 8 kolom wiwitan kosong. Wiwit kolom kasanga, nilaine '5', '2', '7', '8', '1', '9', lan '4'.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_011.png.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</figure><list id="eip-903"><item><emphasis>Sebutna wilangan cacahe nganggo tembung.</emphasis>
<list id="eip-id1170195386307" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Wiwiti saka digit paling kiwa. Sebutna wilangan ing saben periode, banjur jeneng periodene. Jeneng periode satuan aja disebut.</item>
<item>Nganggoa tandha koma nalika nulis wilangan kanggo misahake saben periode.</item></list></item>
<item><emphasis>Nganggoa nilai panggonan kanggo nulis wilangan cacah.</emphasis>
<list id="eip-id1170195386319" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Golekana tembung-tembung sing nuduhake periode. (Elinga, periode satuan ora tau disebut.)</item>
<item>Gawea telung panggonan kosong supaya katon pira panggonan digit sing dibutuhake ing saben periode.</item>
<item>Sebutna wilangan ing saben periode, banjur selehna digit-digite ing posisi nilai panggonan sing bener.</item></list></item>

<item><emphasis>Ayo mbunderake wilangan cacah menyang nilai panggonan tartamtu.</emphasis>
<list id="eip-id1170195386333" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Golekana nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake. Kabeh digit ing sisih kiwane tetep, kajaba yen digit ing nilai panggonan kuwi 9; yen mangkono, digit ing sisih kiwane bisa owah. (Delengen Langkah 3.)</item>
<item>Wenehi garis ing ngisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen nilai panggonan kuwi.</item>
<item>Delengen apa digit iki luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5. Yen iya, tambahna 1 ing digit ing nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake. Yen digit kuwi 9, ganti nganggo 0 lan tambahna 1 ing digit sing pas ing sisih kiwane. Yen digit kuwi uga 9, baleni langkah iki. Yen ora, aja ngowahi digit ing nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake.</item>
<item>Kabeh digit ing sisih tengen nilai panggonan kuwi diganti nganggo nol.</item></list></item>
</list></section><section id="fs-id2279009" class="section-exercises" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<section id="fs-id2318815" class="practice-perfect">
<title>Ayo Latihan supaya Saya Trampil</title>
<para id="fs-id2686876"><emphasis effect="bold">Ayo Ngenali Wilangan Asli lan Wilangan Cacah</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-498">Ing latihan iki, goleki wilangan endi sing kalebu <span class="token">ⓐ</span> wilangan asli lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wilangan cacah.</para><exercise id="fs-id1617693"><problem id="fs-id2475713">
<para id="fs-id1029877"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>8.1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>125</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2686692">
<list id="fs-id1933041" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 5, 125</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0, 5, 125</item></list></solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id834824">
<problem id="fs-id1566499">
<para id="fs-id1321421"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>20.5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>300</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2925019"><problem id="fs-id2186619">
<para id="fs-id1717367"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3.9</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>50</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>221</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1932107">
<list id="fs-id2278021" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 50, 221</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0, 50, 221</item></list>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id2134956">
<problem id="fs-id1367088">
<para id="fs-id2452665"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>303</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>422.6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id2960237"><emphasis effect="bold">Ayo Nggawe Model Wilangan Cacah</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-954">Ing latihan iki, gunakna notasi nilai panggonan kanggo nggoleki nilai wilangan sing dimodelake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>.</para><exercise id="fs-id1224988"><problem id="fs-id2437093">
<media id="fs-id1393361" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 iki isine limang persegi atusan, nem batang puluhan, lan siji blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_201_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1385187">
<para id="fs-id2590572">561</para>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id2646862"><problem id="fs-id2805128">
<media id="fs-id1284927" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 iki isine telung persegi atusan, wolung batang puluhan, lan papat blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_202_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1462995"><problem id="fs-id2946657">
<media id="fs-id2675330" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 iki isine patang persegi atusan lan pitu blok satuan; batang puluhane ora ana.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_203_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2669520">
<para id="fs-id1988320">407</para>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1339977"><problem id="fs-id1577980">
<media id="fs-id2716627" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 iki isine nem persegi atusan lan rong batang puluhan; blok satuane ora ana.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_204_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise><para id="fs-id1362956"><emphasis effect="bold">Ayo Ngenali Nilai Panggonan Saben Digit</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-439">Ing latihan iki, goleki nilai panggonane saben digit sing diwenehake.</para><exercise id="fs-id2466117"><problem id="fs-id1238472">
<para id="fs-id2375962"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>579,601</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<list id="eip-id1168289429789" class="circled" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 9</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 6</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> 0</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> 7</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> 5</item>
</list>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2279435">
<list id="eip-id1168289429815" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> éwuan</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> atusan</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> puluhan</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> puluhan éwu</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> atusan éwu</item>
</list>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1522372"><problem id="fs-id1684233">
<para id="fs-id2208962"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>398,127</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<list id="eip-id1168287380517" class="circled" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 9</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 3</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> 2</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> 8</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> 7</item>
</list>
</problem>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id2197876"><problem id="fs-id2273409">
<para id="fs-id2494777"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>56,804,379</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
