<para id="fs-id3228060"><emphasis effect="bold">Ayo Mbunderake Wilangan Cacah</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-406">Ing latihan iki, bunderna saben wilangan menyang nilai panggonan sing paling cedhak kaya sing dijaluk.</para><exercise id="fs-id2188696"><problem id="fs-id2751447">
