<section id="fs-id1717629" class="everyday">
<title>Matematika Saben Dina</title>
<exercise id="fs-id1294881">
<problem id="fs-id1744657">
<para id="fs-id2692049"><emphasis effect="bold">Nulis Cek</emphasis> Jorge tuku mobil regane <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$24,493</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Dheweke mbayar mobil kuwi nganggo cek. Tulisen rega tukune nganggo tembung.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id764785">
<para id="fs-id2587177">Patlikur éwu, patang atus sangang puluh telu dolar</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2610406">
<problem id="fs-id1899511">
<para id="fs-id2390911"><emphasis effect="bold">Nulis Cek</emphasis> Beya kanggo renovasi pawone Marissa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$18,549</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Dheweke nulis cek kanggo kontraktor. Tulisen gunggunge dhuwit sing dibayar nganggo tembung.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2792494"><problem id="fs-id1816472">
<para id="fs-id1317952"><emphasis effect="bold">Tuku Mobil</emphasis> Jorge tuku mobil regane <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$24,493</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Bunderna regane menyang nilai sing paling cedhak iki:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168288191463" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> sepuluh dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> satus dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> sèwu dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> sepuluh éwu dolar</item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1154314">
<list id="eip-id1168288210369" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> $24,490</item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> $24,500 </item><item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> $24,000 </item><item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> $20,000</item></list></solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1604312"><problem id="fs-id1166211">
<para id="fs-id1932966"><emphasis effect="bold">Renovasi Pawon</emphasis> Beya kanggo renovasi pawone Marissa kuwi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$18,549</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Bunderna beyane menyang nilai sing paling cedhak iki:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168287387980" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> sepuluh dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> satus dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> sèwu dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> sepuluh éwu dolar</item></list></problem>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id2609369"><problem id="fs-id2058233">
<para id="fs-id4171773"><emphasis effect="bold">Cacah Pendhudhuk</emphasis> Cacah pendhudhuk Tiongkok kuwi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1,355,692,544</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2014</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Bunderna cacah pendhudhuke menyang nilai sing paling cedhak iki:</para><list id="eip-id1168289677973" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> siji milyar wong</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> satus yuta wong</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> siji yuta wong</item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1177141"><list id="eip-id1168289677990" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>1,000,000,000</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>1,400,000,000</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mn>1,356,000,000</m:mn></m:math></item></list></solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1806959"><problem id="fs-id1792359">
<para id="fs-id1270274"><emphasis effect="bold">Astronomi</emphasis> Jarak rata-rata antarane bumi lan srengenge kuwi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>149,597,888</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kilometer. Bunderna jarake menyang nilai sing paling cedhak iki:</para><list id="eip-id1168288211528" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> satus yuta kilometer</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> sepuluh yuta kilometer</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> siji yuta kilometer</item></list></problem>
</exercise></section>
<section id="fs-id1345943" class="writing">
<title>Ayo Latihan Nulis</title>
<exercise id="fs-id3202450">
<problem id="fs-id2410682">
<para id="fs-id1946666">Nganggo tembungmu dhewe, coba terangna apa bedane wilangan asli lan wilangan cacah.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1948767">
<para id="fs-id2701563">Wangsulane bisa beda-beda. Wilangan cacah kuwi wilangan asli lan nol.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1258379">
<problem id="fs-id4295295">
<para id="fs-id1350802">Wenehana conto saka uripmu saben dina nalika mbunderake wilangan kuwi migunani.</para>
</problem>
</exercise></section><section id="eip-823" class="self-check"><title>Ayo Priksa Pangertenmu</title><para id="eip-949"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Yen wis rampung latihan, gunakna dhaptar priksa iki kanggo ndeleng sepira anggonmu wis nguwasani tujuan bagean iki. </para>

<figure id="eip-id1165721974706" class="unnumbered"><label /><media id="eip-id1165721974707" alt="Bagan kanggo mbiji pangertenmu dhewe babagan wilangan cacah, nilai panggonan, lan pambunderan. Pilihane “Yakin”, “Nganggo pitulungan”, utawa “Ora, aku durung ngerti”."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_AppB_001.jpg.id-ID.svg" /></media></figure>


<para id="eip-id1168469895457"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Yen tandha centhangmu paling akeh ana ing pilihan... </para>
<para id="eip-id1168469895465">…“Yakin”. Sugeng! Kowe wis nggayuh tujuan bagean iki. Coba pikirna maneh katrampilan sinau sing wis kokanggo supaya bisa kokterusake. Apa sing koktindakake nganti kowe yakin bisa ngrampungake tugas-tugas iki? Jawaben kanthi cetha lan mligi.</para>
<para id="eip-id1168469895472">…“Nganggo pitulungan”. Kahanan iki kudu enggal diatasi, amarga topik sing durung kokkuwasani bisa ngalangi kasilmu. Ing matematika, saben topik gumantung marang materi sadurunge. Sadurunge nerusake, pesthekna dhasarmu wis kuwat. Sapa sing bisa kokjaluki pitulungan? Kanca sakelas lan pengajar bisa mbantu kanthi becik. Apa ing kampusmu ana layanan tutor matematika? Apa katrampilan sinaumu isih bisa kokapiki? </para>
<para id="eip-id1168466338968">…“Ora, aku durung ngerti”. Iki tandha pepeling sing ora kena disepelekake. Enggal golek pitulungan supaya kowe ora enggal kewalahan. Enggal temonana pengajar lan rembugen kahananmu. Kowe lan pengajar bisa bebarengan nyusun rencana supaya entuk pitulungan sing kokbutuhake.</para></section></section></content>
<glossary xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<definition id="fs-id2642858">
<term>koordinat</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2145854">Wilangan sing dipasangake karo sawijining titik ing garis wilangan diarani koordinat titik kuwi.</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id2935860">
<term>wilangan asli</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2567732">Wilangan asli yaiku wilangan 1, 2, 3,…. </meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id2711214">
<term>garis wilangan</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2443061">Garis wilangan dienggo nggambarake wilangan. Wilangane saya gedhé saka kiwa menyang tengen, lan saya cilik saka tengen menyang kiwa.</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id3330600">
<term>titik wiwitan</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2284600">Titik wiwitan yaiku titik sing diwenehi label 0 ing garis wilangan.</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id1336470">
<term>sistem nilai panggonan</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2263265">Sistem wilangan kita diarani sistem nilai panggonan amarga nilaine sawijining digit gumantung marang posisi, utawa panggonane, digit kuwi ing sawijining wilangan.</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id2263270">
<term>pambunderan</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2326485">Nemokake nilai watara sawijining wilangan diarani pambunderan.</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id4338000">
<term>wilangan cacah</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1934263">Wilangan cacah yaiku wilangan 0, 1, 2, 3, ….</meaning>
</definition>
</glossary></document>
